{
  "title": "Mandarin Speaking Coach",
  "tagline": "Practice Mandarin with English guidance and written pinyin.",
  "description": "Practice short Mandarin role-plays and review vocabulary or grammar feedback based on recognized text. Includes written pinyin and English explanations, without pronunciation scoring or saved learning records.",
